 "kind": "clarify",
 "message": "Before I start offboarding, I need two details to confirm for Jordan Blake (E012, Software Engineer (Contractor), Engineering):\n\n1. Reason for the exit. Offboarding through this helpdesk covers voluntary departures only, meaning a resignation or a contract end (POL-OFF-01). If this is a termination for cause, layoff or other involuntary exit, it has to be handled by HR directly and I can't start offboarding for it (POL-OFF-02). Please confirm which applies.\n2. Last working day (YYYY-MM-DD). The directory shows a contract end date of 2027-01-29. Should that be the last day, or is a different date intended?\n\nOnce I have these, I'll start offboarding. Access to all systems will be removed at 17:00 local time on the last day.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-OFF-01",
  "POL-OFF-02"
 ]
}
